  "confirmations_required": 2,
  "redraw_rule": "if the drawn base is NOT TESTABLE (list below, fixed now from the exact simulation of the generated circuits: TVD(P_ideal, uniform) < 0.02), the draw is repeated with blocks H+1, H+2, ... (same rule, same confirmations), at most 20 blocks; every draw is reported",
